# Tier 2 (community) adapters — minimal contract, experimental.
#
# Examples that may land here:
#   freebsd/      — FreeBSD pkg
#   fedora/       — DNF / rpm-ostree
#   alpine/       — apk (musl)
#   chromeos/     — Crostini (Linux container in ChromeOS)
#
# Tier 2 contract: manifest.toml + scripts/<cat>/<phase>.sh + smoke test.
# No Python package required.
#
# See docs/architecture/0006-two-tier-adapter-system.md for promotion path.
